GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`O 3 para 1: the Order is in operation on the date (from 12 November 1998; continued by s 98(2) from 1 December 1999; no revoking instrument found)` MEANS
    d AT LEAST (Date 12 11 1998)

-- src:TA1999-O3:21 | [12th November 1998]
-- src:TA1999-O3:23 | Citation
-- src:TA1999-O3:24 | 1. This Order may be cited as the Telecommunication Authority of
-- src:TA1999-O3:25 | Singapore (Exemption in respect of Specified Equipment) Order.
-- src:TA1999-O3:27 | Exemption
-- src:TA1999-O3:28 | 2. All persons shall be exempted from section 30 (1) to (5) of the
-- src:TA1999-O3:29 | Act in respect of —
-- src:TA1999-O3:30 | (a) any telecommunication equipment that has been approved
-- src:TA1999-O3:31 | for sale by the Authority under regulation 24 (1) of the
-- src:TA1999-O3:32 | Telecommunication (Dealers) Regulations (Rg 7); and
-- src:TA1999-O3:33 | (b) any telecommunication equipment that is set out in the
